<title>USA: Olympus Ventures sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Olympus Ventures sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympus Ventures Inc said on Monday its board of directors unanimously voted to buy back two million shares of the company's common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>&quot;At these prices our company's stock is totally undervalued,&quot; Chief Executive Officer Gary Morgan said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
